Description: Tools to identify persistent dengue transmission hotspots in Mexico.
    Calculates the local spatial statistics Getis-Ord Gi* and local spatial
    heteroscedasticity (Hi), runs space-time analyses (Knox test, SaTScan,
    transmission chains) and fits spatial log-Gaussian Cox process models
    with INLA to map the intensity of dengue cases.
